WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.126 --> 00:00:09.161
&gt;&gt; Tucker: AFTER WEEKS OF

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:10.329
MUCH HYPE AND THEN FALSE

00:00:09.295 --> 00:00:11.730
REPORTS THAT IT HAD BEEN

00:00:10.462 --> 00:00:13.499
STOPPED, THE INFAMOUS

00:00:11.864 --> 00:00:16.135
CARAVAN OF CENTRAL AMERICAN

00:00:13.632 --> 00:00:17.236
MIGRANTS HAS ARRIVED AT THE

00:00:16.268 --> 00:00:18.804
U.S.-MEXICO BORDER.

00:00:17.369 --> 00:00:20.939
HUNDREDS HAVE ARRIVED AT

00:00:18.937 --> 00:00:21.807
MAKESHIFT SETTLEMENT IN

00:00:21.073 --> 00:00:23.242
TIJUANA RIGHT ACROSS THE

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:24.843
BORDER FROM SAN DIEGO.

00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:25.177
SOME MAY PLAN TO SNEAK

00:00:24.977 --> 00:00:26.011
ACROSS.

00:00:25.311 --> 00:00:27.579
OTHERS PROTECT THEMSELVES AT

00:00:26.145 --> 00:00:28.781
THE POINT OF ENTRY AND

00:00:27.713 --> 00:00:29.114
DEMAND ASYLUM IN THIS

00:00:28.914 --> 00:00:29.715
COUNTRY.

00:00:29.248 --> 00:00:31.016
WILL IT WORK?

00:00:29.848 --> 00:00:32.685
HOW DOES THAT WORK.

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:35.087
DEPUTY DIRECTOR OF ICE AND

00:00:32.818 --> 00:00:35.821
HE JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:39.958
THANKS FOR COMING ON.

00:00:35.954 --> 00:00:40.726
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR HAVING ME.

00:00:40.159 --> 00:00:41.327
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WE KNOW THIS

00:00:40.859 --> 00:00:42.561
GROUP HAS BEEN COMING.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:43.495
WE HAVE BEEN WATCHING ON

00:00:42.695 --> 00:00:45.197
VIDEO FOR WEEKS NOW.

00:00:43.629 --> 00:00:49.668
WOULD IT BE POSSIBLE, LEGAL

00:00:45.331 --> 00:00:50.035
TO SAY YOU ARE NOT

00:00:49.802 --> 00:00:51.136
RESIDENTS.

00:00:50.169 --> 00:00:51.470
HAVE YOU NO LEGAL RIGHT TO

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:52.471
COME IN.

00:00:51.603 --> 00:00:52.805
NO YOU CAN'T CROSS THE

00:00:52.604 --> 00:00:54.073
BORDER.

00:00:52.938 --> 00:00:55.874
&gt;&gt; COUPLE THINGS TO DO.

00:00:54.206 --> 00:00:57.309
IF THEY ARE REALLY SEEKING

00:00:56.008 --> 00:00:59.044
ASYLUM, THEY JUST PASSED

00:00:57.443 --> 00:00:59.378
THROUGH A SAFE NATION OF

00:00:59.178 --> 00:01:04.183
MEXICO.

00:00:59.511 --> 00:01:05.084
IF IT'S A MATTER OF LEAVING

00:01:04.316 --> 00:01:07.119
GUATEMALA HONDURAS.

00:01:05.217 --> 00:01:08.253
WENT THROUGH MEXICO THEY CAN

00:01:07.252 --> 00:01:09.488
CLAIM ASYLUM THERE.

00:01:08.387 --> 00:01:10.989
I DON'T KNOW IF THIS IS AS

00:01:09.621 --> 00:01:12.257
MUCH CLAIM ASYLUM OR GETTING

00:01:11.123 --> 00:01:13.192
TO THE UNITED STATES.

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:13.559
&gt;&gt; Tucker: CLEARLY A SCAM,

00:01:13.325 --> 00:01:14.960
OBVIOUSLY.

00:01:13.692 --> 00:01:15.594
WE KNOW THAT BUT WHAT CAN WE

00:01:15.094 --> 00:01:17.162
DO ABOUT IT?

00:01:15.728 --> 00:01:17.763
&gt;&gt; CONGRESS NEEDS TO TAKE

00:01:17.296 --> 00:01:20.065
SOME ACTION.

00:01:17.896 --> 00:01:21.033
WE SENT A LIST OF

00:01:20.199 --> 00:01:22.267
LEGISLATIVE FIX LOOPHOLES

00:01:21.166 --> 00:01:23.969
THEY NEED TO ADDRESS.

00:01:22.401 --> 00:01:25.738
FOR INSTANCE, THE TREASURE

00:01:24.103 --> 00:01:26.905
HOLDS ON CLAIMING FEAR ARE

00:01:25.871 --> 00:01:28.374
SO LOW.

00:01:27.039 --> 00:01:31.844
NEARLY 90% OF PEOPLE CLAIM

00:01:28.507 --> 00:01:32.978
FEAR WILL GET A YES FROM CIS

00:01:31.977 --> 00:01:33.779
BECAUSE THE THRESHOLDS ARE

00:01:33.112 --> 00:01:35.381
SO LOW.

00:01:33.912 --> 00:01:36.682
THEN THEY GO SEE A JUDGE IF

00:01:35.514 --> 00:01:37.015
THEY EVER SHOW UP TO SEE A

00:01:36.815 --> 00:01:39.351
JUDGE.

00:01:37.149 --> 00:01:40.452
THOSE APPROVALS ARE MUCH

00:01:39.485 --> 00:01:42.054
LOWER LIKE 30%.

00:01:40.586 --> 00:01:43.722
WE NEED TO FIX THAT AND MOVE

00:01:42.187 --> 00:01:45.190
THOSE HEARINGS UP IN FRONT

00:01:43.856 --> 00:01:46.625
OF IMMIGRATION JUDGE SO THEY

00:01:45.324 --> 00:01:48.427
HAVE THAT FORMAL HEARING.

00:01:46.759 --> 00:01:50.329
MOST OF THEM DO NOT GET FEAR

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:51.497
FINDING BECAUSE THEY DON'T

00:01:50.462 --> 00:01:51.830
HAVE A CREDIBLE CASE TO

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:53.699
PRESENT.

00:01:51.964 --> 00:01:54.032
THEY NEED TO BE QUICKLY

00:01:53.832 --> 00:01:54.900
REMOVED.

00:01:54.233 --> 00:01:56.568
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOW DOES IT WORK?

00:01:55.033 --> 00:01:57.770
ANYBODY CAN SHOW UP AT THE

00:01:56.702 --> 00:01:59.438
BORDER WITHOUT PAPERS AND

00:01:57.903 --> 00:02:00.906
SAY "I'M IN HERE FOR MY LIFE

00:01:59.571 --> 00:02:02.074
OR I'M AFRAID IN SOME WAY

00:02:01.039 --> 00:02:02.574
AND THEN THEY ARE LET INTO

00:02:02.207 --> 00:02:11.049
THE UNITED STATES?

00:02:02.708 --> 00:02:12.317
&gt;&gt; WELL, THEY WILL BE HELD

00:02:11.183 --> 00:02:13.685
AND INTERVIEWED.

00:02:12.451 --> 00:02:14.620
FAMILY UNIT WE HAVE A NINTH

00:02:13.819 --> 00:02:16.388
CIRCUIT DECISION THAT CAN

00:02:14.753 --> 00:02:18.123
SAY WE CAN ONLY DETAIN

00:02:16.522 --> 00:02:18.991
FAMILY UNITS UP TO 20 DAYS.

00:02:18.257 --> 00:02:20.359
THEY CAN'T POSSIBLY HAVE A

00:02:19.124 --> 00:02:21.627
HEARING IN FRONT OF A JUDGE

00:02:20.492 --> 00:02:23.328
THAT QUICK SO THEY

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:23.962
EVENTUALLY ARE RELEASED.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:24.296
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NEWT UNITED

00:02:24.096 --> 00:02:24.630
STATES?

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:25.497
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:02:24.763 --> 00:02:26.598
WE HAVE ASKED CONGRESS TO

00:02:25.631 --> 00:02:27.499
LOOK AT THAT.

00:02:26.732 --> 00:02:28.066
IT'S CALLED THE FLORIDA

00:02:27.633 --> 00:02:30.102
SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:30.536
WE WANT THEM TO ADDRESS THAT

00:02:30.235 --> 00:02:32.104
LEGISLATIVELY.

00:02:30.669 --> 00:02:33.305
IF THEY CLOSE THESE LOP

00:02:32.237 --> 00:02:33.639
HOLES WE CAN CONTROL THE

00:02:33.439 --> 00:02:36.775
BORDER.

00:02:33.772 --> 00:02:38.377
LAST YEAR 45% -- 45-YEAR LOW

00:02:36.909 --> 00:02:41.180
IN BORDER CROSSINGS BECAUSE

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:43.248
THIS PRESIDENT HAS TAKEN

00:02:41.313 --> 00:02:45.417
BORDER SECURITY SERIOUSLY.

00:02:43.382 --> 00:02:46.385
ICE FINE MEN AND WOMEN OF

00:02:45.551 --> 00:02:47.786
BORDER PATROL DO THE JOB.

00:02:46.518 --> 00:02:49.121
NOW THE SMUGGLERS FIGURE OUT

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:49.688
THE LOOPHOLES AND USE THEM

00:02:49.254 --> 00:02:51.123
AGAINST US.

00:02:49.822 --> 00:02:52.624
CONGRESS NEEDS TO ACT AND

00:02:51.256 --> 00:02:54.026
CLOSE THESE LOOPHOLES SO WE

00:02:52.758 --> 00:02:55.761
CAN DO OUR JOB AND SECURE

00:02:54.159 --> 00:02:56.495
THE BORDER.

00:02:55.961 --> 00:02:58.197
&gt;&gt; Tucker: AS LONG AS YOU

00:02:56.628 --> 00:02:59.364
CLAIM FEAR YOU CANNOT BE

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:59.998
IMMEDIATELY DEPORTED YOU ARE

00:02:59.498 --> 00:03:00.332
RELEASED INTO THE UNITED

00:03:00.132 --> 00:03:01.233
STATES.

00:03:00.466 --> 00:03:02.935
&gt;&gt; IF YOU CLAIM FEAR AND YOU

00:03:01.366 --> 00:03:04.937
GET INTERVIEWED AND CAN YOU

00:03:03.068 --> 00:03:06.772
PASS A VERY LOW THRESHOLD

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:07.706
OF -- AND MOST THESE PEOPLE

00:03:06.905 --> 00:03:09.374
BEING TRAINED AND TAUGHT

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:11.343
WHAT TO SAY BY GROUPS DOWN

00:03:09.508 --> 00:03:12.611
IN MEXICO, COME IN AND MAKE

00:03:11.477 --> 00:03:15.314
THAT CLAIM.

00:03:12.744 --> 00:03:17.516
WE CANNOT REMOVE YOU.

00:03:15.447 --> 00:03:17.916
THOSE CLAIMS HAVE TO BE

00:03:17.649 --> 00:03:18.650
ADJUDICATED.

00:03:18.116 --> 00:03:19.017
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WE ARE BASICALLY

00:03:18.784 --> 00:03:20.652
HELPLESS.

00:03:19.151 --> 00:03:21.253
WE HAVE HAMSTRUNG OURSELVES

00:03:20.786 --> 00:03:23.322
IT SOUNDS LIKE?

00:03:21.386 --> 00:03:24.490
&gt;&gt; AGAIN, IF WE FIX THE

00:03:23.455 --> 00:03:25.424
LOOPHOLES, WE WOULD BE IN A

00:03:24.623 --> 00:03:27.125
LOT BETTER POSITION.

00:03:25.557 --> 00:03:29.461
FOR INSTANCE, THE ADULTS WE

00:03:27.259 --> 00:03:29.928
ARE DETAINING UNTIL THEY SEE

00:03:29.595 --> 00:03:32.130
THE JUDGE.

00:03:30.062 --> 00:03:33.966
THE FAMILY IS THE BIG ISSUE.

00:03:32.264 --> 00:03:35.367
THAT'S WHAT MOST OF THESE

00:03:34.099 --> 00:03:36.502
ARE FAMILY UNIT OR CHILDREN.

00:03:35.501 --> 00:03:37.336
WE HAVE CERTAIN COURT

00:03:36.635 --> 00:03:38.003
DECISIONS THAT LIMIT WHAT WE

00:03:37.469 --> 00:03:39.404
CAN DO.

00:03:38.136 --> 00:03:40.606
HOW LONG WE DETAIN THEM.

00:03:39.538 --> 00:03:40.906
THAT'S WHAT NEEDS TO BE

00:03:40.739 --> 00:03:42.341
FIXED.

00:03:41.039 --> 00:03:43.141
WE PRESENTED THAT TO

00:03:42.474 --> 00:03:43.775
REPRESENTATIVES ON THE HILL

00:03:43.275 --> 00:03:45.477
MONTHS AGO.

00:03:43.909 --> 00:03:50.449
SO, IF THEY REALLY WANT TO

00:03:45.611 --> 00:03:54.353
ADDRESS THIS MIGRATION THEY

00:03:50.582 --> 00:03:54.720
CAN SIMPLY HELP NEWS CLOSING

